## 3. Contact / Support

If you encounter persistent errors, please share:

- The full error message from the R console.
- A short description of the input data (number of rows, columns).
- The values you used for `location_level`, `cusum_h`, `baseline_length_weeks`.

This will help the development team diagnose and fix the issue.
